  "summary": "A Ball State University Alum, I am an accomplished Senior Software Developer and partner of WDD Software. While managing the organization with two other partners, I continue to develop software full-time.\n\nNever one to be caught unprepared, I devote significant effort to the planning of each new project. My keenly intuitive mind allows me to anticipate issues and direct the solution to success.\n\nI have always had a knack for innovation. Over the course of more than a decade as lead developer at WDD, I have been instrumental in the production of countless applications. I am especially enthusiastic when the project is particularly complex and requires carefully executed steps.\n\nOutside of the office, I enjoy watching movies, ballooning, bike riding and all things Star Wars.",
